OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog calls for police to stop
OL,4,Ausing Tasers on children in custody
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's Children and Young People's
OL,7,FCommissioner has called for police to
OL,8,Fstop using Tasers and incapacitating
OL,9,FPava spray on children in custody.
OL,11,FA new report from Nicola Killean's
OL,12,Foffice found that between 2023 and
OL,13,F2024, Tasers were used 43 times against
OL,14,Fchildren in custody settings.
OL,16,FSixteen of these incidents were against
OL,17,Fchildren with mental health issues, 12
OL,18,Fagainst care experienced children, and
OL,19,F10 against children with a learning
OL,20,Fdisability or autism.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
