OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog calls for police to stop
OL,4,Ausing Tasers on children in custody
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland said force was used
OL,7,Fproportionately, legally and only when
OL,8,Fnecessary, but that it would consider
OL,9,Fthe commissioner's recommendations.
